  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Brodetto Marchigiano is a saffron-stained fish stew built on a sharp, vinegar-laced broth. The key technique is building a proper "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "soffritto",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "soffritto"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " before adding the white wine vinegar, which cooks down and melds into the base. This recipe serves 4."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Every Adriatic port has its own take on "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "brodetto ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "brodetto"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", but the Marche version uses saffron and vinegar together. Add the fish in order of cooking time so nothing overcooks."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
